USRBIN        ALCASE                             1                     &
* Salt-only cylindrical mesh: 50 radial x 26 depth bins.
* r=0..1 cm; z=0.31..0.32706812 cm (about 6.57 micrometres/depth bin).
USRBIN            11    PROTON       -29         1         00.32706812PTGTRZ
USRBIN             0         0      0.31        50         1        26 &
#endif
* Prompt Cartesian track-length fluence, unit 30, cm^-2/primary.
* Shared mesh spans the complete apparatus and nearby vacuum.
* Default voxels: 0.5 mm x 0.5 mm x 20 micrometres.
* No DCYSCORE: compare beam/cascade penetration during irradiation.
#if XYZMAP
USRBIN            10    PROTON       -30    $XYMAX    $XYMAX     $ZMAXPXYZ
USRBIN       -$XYMAX   -$XYMAX     $ZMIN      $NXY      $NXY       $NZ &
